01,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"As you bid farewell to the giant mass of tentacles, you hear a large group rushing by and duck out of sight. On the street, Captain Neckbeard is hustling past with some of his crew–a mixture of skeletons and other raggedy scum. Damn, he’s already stolen a few of your potential crew!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.384,"end":18.048,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":53},"large":{"start":0.384,"end":17.84,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":53},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"You can’t let him scoop up any more. If you move quickly, you can beat him to the next crew member. You look at your checklist for the most likely suspects he’s after and make your choice.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":18.24,"end":27.072,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"large":{"start":18.24,"end":27.072,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Do you:","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":27.968,"end":28.46,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":2},"large":{"start":27.968,"end":28.28,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Head in search of a bosun? They can help you handle and supervise the crew as you collect them.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":29.088,"end":34.112,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":19},"large":{"start":29.088,"end":34.112,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"Or","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":34.592,"end":34.92,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"large":{"start":34.592,"end":34.74,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"Head to the park, which might host a ship's carpenter in search of wood, as well as being the central gathering place of many a picnicking pirate having a drink or three?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":35.424,"end":45.216,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":32},"large":{"start":35.424,"end":45.216,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":32},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68fbf29f46b07_JM3.jpg"}